---
kind: lore
id: north.catches
title: North catch reactions
---

// caught@mon.<species> for the north's scripted monsters. The engine has
// already asserted caught() when these play (spine.firstCatch is the
// untargeted fallback at -10).

<beat id="shellnessie" on="caught" target="mon.shellnessie" title="The Friday swimmer">
  @narrator: The swimmer settles into its ball without a fight, as if it had been waiting to be asked.
  @frostharborCaveGuide{vo}: {{userName}}? Halvard here. Ilse just ran up the harbor shouting that you caught the Friday swimmer. Is it true? It's true, isn't it.
</beat>

<beat id="frostwing" on="caught" target="mon.frostwing" title="The ice bird">
  @narrator: The ball frosts over in {{userName}}'s hand, then clears. Frostwing is caught.
  @profAlder{vo}: {{userName}}! My instruments just froze. Literally. Is that a Frostwing in your party? Do you know how many centuries — never mind. Keep it warm. No, keep it cold!
</beat>

<beat id="blazewing" on="caught" target="mon.blazewing" title="The fire bird">
  @narrator: The ball glows red, and then, very slowly, cools. Blazewing is caught.
  @profAlder{vo}: {{userName}}, the lab thermometer just went past the top. Blazewing! The miners' stories were true. I'm going to need a bigger notebook.
</beat>
